### Requests for testing the Notes API.
### Install the "REST Client" extension in VS Code, then click "Send Request" above any request.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### List all notes
GET {{base}}/api/notes

### Search notes
GET {{base}}/api/notes?search=express

### Get one note
GET {{base}}/api/notes/1

### A note that doesn't exist (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/api/notes/999

### Create a note (expect 201)
POST {{base}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy coffee",
  "body": "Beans, not instant!"
}

### Invalid note (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "I forgot the title"
}

### Update a note
PUT {{base}}/api/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Express (done!)",
  "body": "Routes, middleware, JSON and errors."
}

### Delete a note (expect 204)
DELETE {{base}}/api/notes/2
